---
import DocsLayout from "../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout
  title="alert-notify Documentation: API"
  description="Reference for alert-notify toast methods, per-toast options, promise helpers, createToaster, and headless subscribe APIs."
  keywords="alert-notify API, toast.success, toast.promise, createToaster"
  pageTitle="API"
>
  <p>
    Full method and options reference for the core package. Nothing is required beyond importing.
    CSS is included from the package entry. The portal auto-mounts.
  </p>

  <h2>Required setup</h2>
  <pre class="api"><code>{`import { toast } from "alert-notify";

toast.success("Hello");`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Methods</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Method</th><th>Returns</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>toast(message, options?)</code></td><td><code>ToastId</code></td><td>Generic toast (<code>message</code> type). Message may be <code>string | undefined</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.success(message, options?)</code></td><td><code>ToastId</code></td><td>Success toast</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.error(message, options?)</code></td><td><code>ToastId</code></td><td>Error toast</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.warning(message, options?)</code></td><td><code>ToastId</code></td><td>Warning toast</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.info(message, options?)</code></td><td><code>ToastId</code></td><td>Info toast</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.loading(message, options?)</code></td><td><code>ToastId</code></td><td>Loading toast (<code>autoClose: false</code> by default)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.message(message, options?)</code></td><td><code>ToastId</code></td><td>Neutral message toast</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.custom(content, options?)</code></td><td><code>ToastId</code></td><td>Custom HTML string or <code>HTMLElement</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.promise(promise, messages)</code></td><td><code>Promise&lt;T&gt;</code></td><td>Loading → success/error on same id</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.dismiss(id?)</code></td><td><code>void</code></td><td>Dismiss one toast, or all if omitted</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.isActive(id)</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td>Whether that toast id is still open</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.config(partial)</code></td><td><code>void</code></td><td>Update global toaster defaults</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.getConfig()</code></td><td><code>ToasterConfig</code></td><td>Read current global config</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.getToasts()</code></td><td><code>ToastRecord[]</code></td><td>Current toast list (headless)</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.subscribe(listener)</code></td><td><code>() =&gt; void</code></td><td>Subscribe to toast list changes</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>toast.destroy()</code></td><td><code>void</code></td><td>Dismiss all + remove portal</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>createToaster(config?, options?)</code></td><td><code>ToasterInstance</code></td><td>Isolated toaster (multi-instance)</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>Per-toast options</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Option</th><th>Type</th><th>Default</th><th>Description</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td><code>id</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>auto UUID</td><td>Stable id. Same id updates in place</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>type</code></td><td><code>ToastType</code></td><td>from method</td><td><code>success | error | warning | info | loading | message</code></td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>title</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>-</td><td>Optional heading</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>duration</code></td><td><code>number</code></td><td>from config</td><td>Ms until auto-close when <code>autoClose</code> is true</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>autoClose</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>true</code> (<code>false</code> for loading)</td><td>Whether the toast auto-dismisses</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>icon</code></td><td><code>string | HTMLElement | false</code></td><td>built-in SVG</td><td>Custom icon HTML/node, or <code>false</code> to hide. Framework entries also accept framework nodes</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>action</code></td><td><code>{"{ label, onClick }"}</code></td><td>-</td><td>Primary action button</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>cancel</code></td><td><code>{"{ label, onClick }"}</code></td><td>-</td><td>Secondary cancel button</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>closeButton</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td>from config</td><td>Show × button</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>dismissible</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td>from config</td><td>Allow swipe / close dismiss</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>important</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td><code>false</code></td><td>Jump to front of the queue</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>position</code></td><td><code>ToastPosition</code></td><td>from config</td><td>Override stack corner for this toast</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>richColors</code></td><td><code>boolean</code></td><td>from config</td><td>Override tinted surface for this toast</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>className</code></td><td><code>string</code></td><td>-</td><td>Extra class on the toast element</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>style</code></td><td><code>object</code></td><td>-</td><td>Inline styles on the toast</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>onOpen</code></td><td><code>(toast) =&gt; void</code></td><td>-</td><td>Fired once when the toast is first created</td></tr>
        <tr><td><code>onClose</code></td><td><code>(toast, reason) =&gt; void</code></td><td>-</td><td>Fired once; <code>reason</code> is <code>"Manual"</code> or <code>"Auto"</code></td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <h2>Promise API</h2>
  <pre class="api"><code>{`toast.promise(uploadFile(), {
  loading: "Uploading…",
  success: (file) => \`Uploaded \${file.name}\`,
  error: (err) => (err instanceof Error ? err.message : "Failed"),
});`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Multiple toasters and headless</h2>
  <pre class="api"><code>{`import { createToaster } from "alert-notify";

const modalToast = createToaster({ position: "bottom-center" });
modalToast.success("Saved in modal");

const headless = createToaster({}, { headless: true });
headless.subscribe((toasts) => {
  // render custom UI from toasts[]
});`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Behavior notes</h2>
  <ul class="notes">
    <li>Title and message are HTML-escaped by default. Use <code>toast.custom()</code> for trusted markup.</li>
    <li><code>loading</code> toasts default to sticky until updated (for example via promise).</li>
    <li>Same <code>id</code> coalesces instead of stacking a duplicate. <code>onOpen</code> does not re-fire on coalesce.</li>
    <li>Per-toast <code>position</code> uses a separate stack from the default corner.</li>
    <li>Per-toast <code>richColors</code> overrides the toaster default for that toast only.</li>
    <li>Escape dismisses the focused toast. Swipe dismisses when <code>dismissible</code> is true.</li>
    <li>SSR-safe: no DOM work until <code>document</code> exists.</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Also see <a href="/docs/config">Config</a>.</p>
</DocsLayout>
